# Bot1 has Rest in Peace out by turn 1 (Mox Pearl and Plains). Bot2's Haywire Mite ("when this creature dies, you gain 2
# life") is destroyed by Bot1's Lightning Bolt on turn 3: the Mite card would be put into its owner's graveyard, and is
# exiled instead (CR 614.1a), so it never dies and Bot2 gains nothing. Bot1's own Bolt is exiled as it finishes
# resolving, so neither graveyard holds anything: it applies to every player's cards.

